{"title":"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/7/b57fad2021b359526a23a86fb55e44aa6c3817c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin(2x) = \\frac{1}{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"91\" height=\"37\" />.  Find the numerical value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/7/e77b1ed8be4f00816f15cd6ef39a4cdce6496d29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin(x)\\sin(x)\\sin(x)\\sin(x) + \\cos(x)\\cos(x)\\cos(x)\\cos(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"422\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/7/0974ad2becd15648c0742a872498de6da146eeb8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) }\\frac{2305}{2401}\\qquad \\text{(B) }\\frac{4610}{2401}\\qquad \\text{(C) }\\frac{2400}{2401}\\qquad \\text{(D) }\\frac{6915}{2401}\\qquad \\text{(E) }\\frac{1}{2401}\\qquad \\text{(F) }0\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"558\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/0/5309b1700ed946735b20543f58651af49b22a61b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(G) }\\frac{195}{196}\\qquad \\text{(H) }\\frac{195}{98}\\qquad \\text{(I) }\\frac{97}{98}\\qquad \\text{(J) }\\frac{1}{49}\\qquad \\text{(K) }\\frac{2}{49}\\qquad \\text{(L) }\\frac{48}{49}\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"489\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/9/6e939c5472b09f8fe11e41811f81a6b20af8bec8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(M) }\\frac{96}{49}\\qquad \\text{(N) }\\pi\\qquad \\text{(O) }\\text{none of the above}\\qquad \\text{(P) }1\\qquad  \\text{(Q) }2\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"469\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that adding and subtracting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/1/b21cef460984d0bfaf1d8e5d0ed4dbd63ce82aeb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\sin^2(x)\\cos^2(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"124\" height=\"20\" /> in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/5/b852e653f9e82b1ca33c70c702933b4bfed9c379.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin^4(x) + \\cos^4(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"131\" height=\"20\" /> results in a factorable expression: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/9/5e9b5f6d261d1eae2ae6a4dd54f6c4a8e1c018a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin^4(x) + 2\\sin^2(x)\\cos^2(x) + \\cos^4(x) - 2\\sin^2(x)\\cos^2(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"427\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nThe first three terms can be factored into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/0/3e0afcdd6f55e52f6156192e25c282f3a364f308.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\sin^2(x) + \\cos^2(x))^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"153\" height=\"20\" />, which simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.  Also, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/9/2f900997d24d29686d96e7474a0c1b3d8f4375d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin(2x) = 2\\sin(x)\\cos(x) = \\frac{1}{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"227\" height=\"37\" />, we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37f2e87bb5cb32825b8060353aa491bb4052f4c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\sin^2(x)\\cos^2(x) = \\tfrac12 \\cdot 4\\sin^2(x)\\cos^2(x) = \\tfrac12 \\cdot (2\\sin(x)\\cos(x))^2 = \\tfrac{1}{98}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"519\" height=\"22\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nThus, the expression equals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/a/c6ae4a7f845f38f229b630f83f3d5c7272f9ea9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 - \\tfrac{1}{98} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(I) } \\tfrac{97}{98}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"130\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest\" title=\"2006 iTest\">2006 iTest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems\">(Problems</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 iTest Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/w